*
!*/
!.gitignore
!makefile
!README.md
!*.c
!*.h
!/lib/*.dll
!/lib/*.so
!/lib/*.dylib
!*.svg
!*.png

# CMake build definition. This file ignores everything first and re-includes only what belongs in the
# repository, so the CMake entry points have to be re-included explicitly or they would be dropped silently.
!/CMakeLists.txt
!/CMakePresets.json
!*.cmake

# The CMake output tree has to be excluded last, after the re-inclusions above. It contains files that match
# them, such as CMakeCCompiler.cmake, CMakeSystem.cmake and CMakeCCompilerId.c, so a plain deny on the
# directory placed any earlier would be undone and the cache would end up in the repository.
/build/